From: Code and Solder <codeandsolder@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath12k: report successful AHB probe before ICC synchronization

Temporary chronological breadcrumb at platform probe return, next to
the separate interconnect/clock sync trace. No device behavior change.

Signed-off-by: Code and Solder <codeandsolder@gmail.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/ahb.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/ahb.c
@@ -1141,10 +1141,12 @@
 		ath12k_err(ab, "AHB arch_init failed %d\n", ret);
 		goto err_rproc_deconfigure;
 	}
 
 	ret = ath12k_core_init(ab);
+	if (!ret)
+		ath12k_info(ab, "ath12k probe-complete: bus=%d\n", ab->hif.bus);
 	if (ret) {
 		ath12k_err(ab, "failed to init core: %d\n", ret);
 		goto err_deinit_arch;
 	}
 
